<script setup lang="ts">
import {computed} from 'vue';import {openingKindLabels,openingWeekdays,operatingCode,operatingLabel} from '../../shared/place-opening';import type {StudioPlace} from './content-studio-api';
const props=defineProps<{place:StudioPlace}>(),schedule=computed(()=>props.place.openingSchedule!);
const operating=computed({get:()=>operatingCode(props.place.publicStatus),set:value=>props.place.publicStatus=value});
</script>
<template><details open class="studio-opening-fields"><summary>开放情况</summary><p>运营状态与开放安排分别记录。正常运营不等于每天开放；此处不判断“现在营业”。</p><div class="form-grid"><label>运营状态<select v-model="operating" aria-label="运营状态"><option value="开放">正常运营</option><option value="关闭">暂停开放</option><option value="在建">在建 / 尚未开放</option><option value="待核实">待核实</option><option v-if="!['开放','关闭','在建','待核实'].includes(operating)" :value="operating">{{operatingLabel(operating,'zh')}}（保留原状态）</option></select></label><label>开放安排<select aria-label="开放安排" v-model="schedule.kind" @change="schedule.confirmed=false"><option v-for="(label,key) in openingKindLabels" :value="key">{{label.zh}}</option></select></label></div>
<fieldset v-if="schedule.kind==='weekdays'"><legend>开放星期（可多选）</legend><div class="theme-checks"><label v-for="day in openingWeekdays" :key="day.id"><input type="checkbox" v-model="schedule.weekdays" :value="day.id" @change="schedule.confirmed=false">{{day.zh}}</label></div></fieldset><p v-if="schedule.kind==='weekends'">仅周六、周日；节假日与临时闭馆请写在补充说明中。</p>
<div class="form-grid"><label>开放时段（中文，选填）<input v-model="schedule.hours.zh" placeholder="例如 09:00–12:00、14:00–17:00；不确定时留空"></label><label>Opening hours（English，选填）<input v-model="schedule.hours.en"></label><label class="wide">补充说明（中文）<textarea v-model="schedule.notes.zh" placeholder="节假日、临时闭馆、预约要求等"></textarea></label><label class="wide">Additional notes（English，选填）<textarea v-model="schedule.notes.en"></textarea></label><label>信息来源（中文）<input v-model="schedule.source.zh" placeholder="现场公告、工作人员说明、官方链接等"></label><label>Source（English，选填）<input v-model="schedule.source.en"></label><label>开放安排最后核实日期<input v-model="schedule.lastVerifiedAt" type="date"></label><label class="inline-check"><input v-model="schedule.confirmed" type="checkbox" :disabled="schedule.kind==='unknown'||schedule.kind==='weekdays'&&!schedule.weekdays.length">已核实此开放安排</label></div><p>未勾选核实标记时，访客预览显示“时间待核实”。核实日期由您填写，不使用编辑或保存日期。</p></details></template>
